{"id":5372,"date":"2025-08-31T15:19:26","date_gmt":"2025-08-31T08:19:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5372"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:20:01","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:20:01","slug":"amazon-prime-la-gi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-amazon\/amazon-prime-la-gi\/","title":{"rendered":"Amazon Prime l\u00e0 g\u00ec? D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u00e0 ti\u1ec7n \u00edch c\u1ee7a Amazon Prime"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"EgQCdVipzobWMPxRzmnlXyswgxb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kebgd7BiRouPyjxbeArlrv73gdh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon Prime kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01a1n thu\u1ea7n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 giao h\u00e0ng nhanh. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t g\u00f3i th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean cao c\u1ea5p, m\u1ed9t h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Amazon x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng \u0111\u1ec3 mang l\u1ea1i tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m \u0111\u1ec9nh cao cho nh\u1eefng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trung th\u00e0nh nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D9FddFaQyod1pwxsb2KlP0mAgVO\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p h\u00e0ng lo\u1ea1t d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u1eeb mua s\u1eafm, gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed cho \u0111\u1ebfn l\u01b0u tr\u1eef ch\u1ec9 trong m\u1ed9t g\u00f3i \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd duy nh\u1ea5t, Prime \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng th\u00e2n thi\u1ebft th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng nh\u1ea5t th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K775dwsPhopRRTxbSdtlnQYzgWg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y c\u1ee7a <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 Amazon Prime l\u00e0 g\u00ec v\u00e0 kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c ti\u1ec7n \u00edch \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n m\u00e0 g\u00f3i th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean n\u00e0y mang l\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NHA0dREWEohBn6xcPSYl1tuLgMe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon Prime l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Ztn3dS6g2oYVlpxhS7clq3xigfe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;96f81f3d-2c75-4e4b-9540-071f36f69505&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FPIgUblNFJoz0PCxayOylzqqzgIb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;PIgUblNFJoz0PCxayOylzqqzgIb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:116720,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;96f81f3d-2c75-4e4b-9540-071f36f69505&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FPIgUblNFJoz0PCxayOylzqqzgIb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;PIgUblNFJoz0PCxayOylzqqzgIb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:116720,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5373\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5373\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5373\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/141dfa93-cc62-4d9e-9e7c-4c310d0028c5.png\" alt=\"Amazon Prime l\u00e0 g\u00ec?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/141dfa93-cc62-4d9e-9e7c-4c310d0028c5.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/141dfa93-cc62-4d9e-9e7c-4c310d0028c5-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/141dfa93-cc62-4d9e-9e7c-4c310d0028c5-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/141dfa93-cc62-4d9e-9e7c-4c310d0028c5-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/141dfa93-cc62-4d9e-9e7c-4c310d0028c5-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5373\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Amazon Prime l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"EgQCdVipzobWMPxRzmnlXyswgxb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FL2vddDVeoF15uxKH3jlxxYZgQe\"><strong>Amazon Prime<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean tr\u1ea3 ph\u00ed c\u1ee7a Amazon, cung c\u1ea5p cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t lo\u1ea1t c\u00e1c \u0111\u1eb7c quy\u1ec1n v\u00e0 l\u1ee3i \u00edch m\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u01b0: truy c\u1eadp kh\u00f4ng gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3 g\u1ed3m c\u00e1c b\u1ed9 phim \u0111i\u1ec7n \u1ea3nh, ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh truy\u1ec1n h\u00ecnh n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng, th\u01b0\u1edfng th\u1ee9c h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u b\u00e0i h\u00e1t v\u00e0 podcast,&#8230; \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 g\u00f3i giao h\u00e0ng mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u00e0 si\u00eau t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb s\u00e0n TM\u0110T h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mm0PdwGFooqcPTxUq7RlrW2Vglb\">Ban \u0111\u1ea7u, Prime \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ra \u0111\u1eddi v\u00e0o n\u0103m 2005 v\u1edbi m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 giao h\u00e0ng nhanh mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed trong v\u00f2ng hai ng\u00e0y cho c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n. Tuy nhi\u00ean, qua nhi\u1ec1u n\u0103m ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n, Amazon \u0111\u00e3 kh\u00f4ng ng\u1eebng b\u1ed5 sung v\u00e0o g\u00f3i Prime v\u00f4 s\u1ed1 c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb kh\u00e1c, bi\u1ebfn n\u00f3 th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed v\u00e0 mua s\u1eafm to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-FkOcdB2kpooXgfxlsKolBqgMgEh\">C\u00e1c ti\u1ec7n \u00edch ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a Amazon Prime<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YaoUdkqzFoF6h9xA6IQlv2WFg1c\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a Amazon Prime n\u1eb1m \u1edf s\u1ef1 \u0111a d\u1ea1ng c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c ti\u1ec7n \u00edch m\u00e0 n\u00f3 mang l\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-TSlHdq9eBo5Qljx9u41l2Bu6gmR\">Mua s\u1eafm v\u00e0 Giao h\u00e0ng<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-G3aGddS0doeqshxAD1jlMpIYg4f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;513d0b10-e3d2-4f57-937f-3992ee9e10e5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FLtxWbxK0zofg6ExoLBBlXfl7gu8%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;LtxWbxK0zofg6ExoLBBlXfl7gu8&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:522702,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;513d0b10-e3d2-4f57-937f-3992ee9e10e5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FLtxWbxK0zofg6ExoLBBlXfl7gu8%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;LtxWbxK0zofg6ExoLBBlXfl7gu8&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:522702,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5374\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5374\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5374\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/5f401876-0cc0-4e00-b71f-819c9c820a76.png\" alt=\"Mua s\u1eafm v\u00e0 Giao h\u00e0ng v\u1edbi Amazon Prime\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/5f401876-0cc0-4e00-b71f-819c9c820a76.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/5f401876-0cc0-4e00-b71f-819c9c820a76-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/5f401876-0cc0-4e00-b71f-819c9c820a76-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/5f401876-0cc0-4e00-b71f-819c9c820a76-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/5f401876-0cc0-4e00-b71f-819c9c820a76-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5374\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Mua s\u1eafm v\u00e0 Giao h\u00e0ng v\u1edbi Amazon Prime<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"EgQCdVipzobWMPxRzmnlXyswgxb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DRBFdTWaOokOBBx3hgolxyvOg9B\">\u0110\u00e2y v\u1eabn l\u00e0 l\u1ee3i \u00edch c\u1ed1t l\u00f5i v\u00e0 h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a Prime.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CY6bd2q1Ho9KGoxehHUlPWPngEe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Giao h\u00e0ng mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u00e0 si\u00eau t\u1ed1c:<\/strong> Th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean Prime \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u01b0\u1edfng c\u00e1c t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn giao h\u00e0ng c\u1ef1c nhanh m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng m\u1ea5t th\u00eam ph\u00ed, bao g\u1ed3m: Giao h\u00e0ng trong ng\u00e0y (Prime Free Same-Day), Giao h\u00e0ng trong m\u1ed9t ng\u00e0y (One-Day), v\u00e0 Giao h\u00e0ng trong hai ng\u00e0y (Two-Day Shipping) cho h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CBvodPLX1owvERxkLAmlCJ0dgqe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u01afu \u0111\u00e3i \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n Prime Day:<\/strong> Prime Day l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t trong n\u0103m c\u1ee7a Amazon, k\u00e9o d\u00e0i 48 gi\u1edd v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9 d\u00e0nh ri\u00eang cho c\u00e1c th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean Prime. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ec3 s\u0103n h\u00e0ng ngh\u00ecn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 c\u1ef1c s\u00e2u tr\u00ean m\u1ecdi ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FF5xdkoiHoPM7kxmn3Vl1mgmgEg\">Vi\u1ec7c c\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u00e3n &#8220;Prime&#8221; tr\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ee3i th\u1ebf c\u1ea1nh tranh c\u1ef1c l\u1edbn cho c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, gi\u00fap t\u0103ng uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 doanh s\u1ed1 \u0111\u00e1ng k\u1ec3. \u0110\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n th\u01b0\u1eddng ph\u1ea3i s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 FBA v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng c\u00e1c ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh kh\u1eaft khe. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a quy tr\u00ecnh n\u00e0y, vi\u1ec7c h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p nh\u01b0 <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong> th\u00f4ng qua <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/dich-vu\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 V\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Gian h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean s\u00e0n Amazon<\/a><\/strong> c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 gi\u00fap h\u1ecd qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd chi ph\u00ed v\u00e0 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-ITGBd5VgvozhpHx5CiPlBICAgZO\">Gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-AOuJdNt4Wo3rUZx6X30lTgdZgUd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d98de8e3-672a-4e84-8128-3d579d514362&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FTehlbC97ooDTAqxvU8Yl6NcDgNc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;TehlbC97ooDTAqxvU8Yl6NcDgNc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:677133,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-