block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UmAidYbzuo2QEcxHNKvl0JAFgBf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Prime Video:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp kh\u00f4ng gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3 g\u1ed3m c\u00e1c b\u1ed9 phim \u0111i\u1ec7n \u1ea3nh, ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh truy\u1ec1n h\u00ecnh n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 c\u00e1c series phim g\u1ed1c do Amazon s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t (Amazon Originals) \u0111\u00e3 gi\u00e0nh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U647dlyXForyZMxTie1lNLtxgJc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Prime Music:<\/strong> Th\u01b0\u1edfng th\u1ee9c h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u b\u00e0i h\u00e1t v\u00e0 podcast m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb l\u00e0m phi\u1ec1n b\u1edfi qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VArpdSWm9oxbQcxInlal1puigIh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Prime Reading:<\/strong> Truy c\u1eadp mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n lu\u00e2n phi\u00ean g\u1ed3m h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0n cu\u1ed1n s\u00e1ch \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, t\u1ea1p ch\u00ed v\u00e0 truy\u1ec7n tranh Kindle.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NT3VdH3C5odIsjxPXvElf6Rjg4b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Twitch Prime:<\/strong> N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t game th\u1ee7, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e1c n\u1ed9i dung game \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n, game mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t g\u00f3i \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd k\u00eanh Twitch mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Adfvd3dZmoHSt9xTN5tlfc0QgTe\">C\u00e1c l\u1ee3i \u00edch kh\u00e1c<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-UJQCdeIjOoeWtJxUMtxl